  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">FEP:TT0056 Programa de Gobierno Electronico e Intermediacin del Conocimientos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEP:TT0056 Electronic Government  Knowledge Brokering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to support the preparation and initial implementation of the Information and Communication Technology (ICT) Support Program (TT-0056). This program is designed to assist Trinidad and Tobago
implement its National Information and Communication Plan or
fastforward in the following areas: (a) Legal and Regulatory
Framework; (b) E-government; (c) Human Capital Development;
(d) Connectivity; and (e) Enterprise Development in ICT.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
